---
import Preview from "../components/1/preview.astro";
import bannerLight from "../images/bayphl-banner-light.svg";
import bannerDark from "../images/bayphl-banner-dark.svg";
import bannerVerticalDark from "../images/bayphl-logo-vertical-dark.svg";
import bannerVerticalLight from "../images/bayphl-logo-vertical-light.svg";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/modern-css-reset@1.4.0/dist/reset.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:ital,wght@0,200..1000;1,200..1000&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>BAyPHL: The Bay Area Puzzle Hunt League</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="root">
      <header>
        <picture id="logo">
          <source
            media={`(max-width: 768px) and (prefers-color-scheme: light)`}
            srcset={bannerVerticalDark.src}
          />
          <source
            media={`(max-width: 768px) and (prefers-color-scheme: dark)`}
            srcset={bannerVerticalLight.src}
          />
          <source
            media={`(prefers-color-scheme: dark)`}
            srcset={bannerLight.src}
          />
          <source srcset={bannerDark.src} />
          <img src={bannerDark.src} alt="BAyPHL" />
        </picture>
        <h1>Bay Area Puzzle Hunt League</h1>
      </header>
      <div id="main">
        <h2>Coming Soon!</h2>

        <Preview />

        <h2>About BAyPHL</h2>

        <p class="intro">
          BAyPHL is the <strong>Bay Area Puzzle Hunt League</strong>, a
          semi-regularly recurring, in-person puzzle hunts taking place in the
          San Francisco Bay Area.
        </p>

        <dl>
          <section class="card">
            <dt>What is a puzzle hunt?</dt>
            <dd>
              <p>
                A puzzle hunt is a game in which players solve a series of
                difficult puzzles that require various logical,
                lateral-thinking, and creative skills to solve. These puzzles
                often come without explicit instructions on how to solve them,
                requiring players to determine the rules and logic behind each
                puzzle on their own.
              </p>

              <p>
                If you want to explore more puzzle hunts besides BAyPHL, check
                out <a
                  href="https://puzzledpint.org/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer">Puzzled Pint</a
                >, <a
                  href="https://playdash.org/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer">DASH</a
                >, and the <a
                  href="https://puzzlehuntcalendar.com/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer">Puzzle Hunt Calendar</a
                >.
              </p>
            </dd>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <dt>How is BAyPHL different?</dt>
            <dd>
              Traditionally, BAyPHL is built to incorporate specific physical
              locations, requiring teams to visit and explore sites in order to
              discover and solve puzzles.
            </dd>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <dt>Who runs BAyPHL?</dt>
            <dd>
              While there is a small team that coordinates and helps promote
              BAyPHL events, there’s no one team that runs BAyPHL. Each event is
              written and run by various groups of puzzle enthusiast volunteers
              from the Bay Area and beyond.
            </dd>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <dt>Can I run a BAyPHL?</dt>
            <dd>
              <p>
                Sure! We want to enable more Bay Area puzzle hunts. Not sure you
                want to write something new? We’re also happy to help you
                recreate old puzzle hunts from the Bay Area or elsewhere. Did
                you run a puzzle hunt 20 years ago that the kids these days
                might not know about?
              </p>

              <p>
                Let’s talk! Reach out to <a href="mailto:bayphl@bayphl.org"
                  >bayphl@bayphl.org</a
                >
              </p>
            </dd>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <dt>How can I learn more?</dt>
            <dd>
              If you’re interested in learning about future BAyPHL events, <a
                href="https://groups.google.com/g/bayphl-announce"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                subscribe to our announcement list
              </a> or <a
                href="https://bsky.app/profile/bayphl.org"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">follow us on social media</a
              >
            </dd>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <dt>Where did the name come from?</dt>
            <dd>
              Frankly, “BAPHL” might be a better name, but it was already taken
              by our friends at the <a href="https://baphl.org"
                >Boston Area Puzzle Hunt League</a
              >, so we needed some way to distinguish ourselves.
            </dd>
          </section>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>

    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --color-teal: #2c5f5a;
        --color-coral: #e07a5f;
        --color-dark-coral: #d4603f;
        --color-sage: #81b29a;
        --color-navy: #1a2332;
        --color-deep-navy: #1f2937;
        --color-cream: #f2e9e4;
        --color-light-gray: #e9ecef;
        --color-smoke: #1a1611;
        --color-earth: #2a241c;
        --color-bistre: #2f2821;
        --color-taupe: #3d3529;
        --color-salmon: #ae8877;
        --color-melon: #ffb3a3;

        --font-sans: "Nunito", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif,
          "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol",
          "Noto Color Emoji";
      }

      :root {
        --color-background: var(--color-cream);
        --color-surface: white;
        --color-text: var(--color-navy);
        --color-header-text: var(--color-cream);
        --color-heading-text: var(--color-teal);
        --color-card-border: var(--color-light-gray);
        --color-card-background: white;
        --color-link: var(--color-coral);
        --color-link-hover: var(--color-dark-coral);
        --color-focus: var(--color-teal);
        --color-surface-shadow: rgba(44, 95, 90, 0.08);
        --color-card-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        --color-card-shadow-hover: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      }

      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --color-background: var(--color-smoke);
          --color-surface: var(--color-earth);
          --color-text: var(--color-cream);
          --color-header-text: var(--color-navy);
          --color-heading-text: var(--color-sage);
          --color-card-border: var(--color-taupe);
          --color-card-background: var(--color-bistre);
          --color-link: var(--color-salmon);
          --color-link-hover: var(--color-melon);
          --color-focus: var(--color-sage);
          --color-surface-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
          --color-card-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
          --color-card-shadow-hover: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }
      }

      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
      }

      body {
        background: var(--color-background);
        color: var(--color-text);
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    </style>

    <style>
      #root {
        max-width: 1024px;
        min-height: 100vh;
        margin-inline: auto;
        background: var(--color-surface);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 32px var(--color-surface-shadow);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      header {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--color-teal) 0%,
          var(--color-sage) 100%
        );
        color: var(--color-header-text);
        padding-block: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      #logo {
        width: 100%;
        padding-inline: 15%;
        height: auto;
        margin-right: 1rem;
      }
      #logo img {
        width: 100%;
        margin-inline: auto;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      }
      a {
        color: var(--color-link);
      }
      a:hover {
        color: var(--color-link-hover);
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      a:focus {
        outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
        outline-offset: 2px;
        border-radius: 2px;
      }
      #main {
        padding: 1rem 2rem;
      }
      #main h2 {
        color: var(--color-heading-text);
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;

        &:first-of-type {
          margin-top: 0;
        }
      }
      #main .intro {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
      }
      #main p {
        color: var(--color-text);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      #main dl {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 1rem;

        & .card {
          border: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
          background: var(--color-card-background);
          border-radius: 0.5rem;
          padding: 1rem;
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
          box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--color-card-shadow);
          transition: box-shadow 0.1s ease-in-out;

          &:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px var(--color-card-shadow-hover);
          }

          &:focus-within {
            outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
            outline-offset: 2px;
          }
        }

        & dt {
          font-weight: 700;
          font-size: 1.5rem;
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
          color: var(--color-heading-text);
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        #root {
          max-width: 768px;
        }

        #main dl {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        #logo img {
          width: 185px;
        }

        header {
          gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        #main {
          padding-inline: 1rem;
        }

        #main dl {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
